_⚠️ Potential issue_ | _🟡 Minor_

**Guard against undefined `storyId`.**

If no story is selected (e.g., user is on the about page), `storyId` will be undefined, and `getStoryHrefs` may produce an invalid URL or throw. Consider adding a guard similar to other shortcut handlers that depend on story context.

<details>
<summary>🔎 Proposed fix</summary>

```diff
 case 'openInIsolation': {
+  if (!storyId) {
+    break;
+  }
   const { previewHref } = fullAPI.getStoryHrefs(storyId, { refId });
   window.open(previewHref, '_blank', 'noopener,noreferrer');
   break;
 }
```
</details>

